TimS baits hook, robin-fish bites.

Well, all you need to do is identify relevant questions, and possible
answers, which should become clearly resolved no matter what the
truth of AIDS.  Like:

Can AIDS be transmitted through bodily fluids that don't contain a HIV
viris?

Would AIDS patients whose bodies had been rid of HIV virises, at
different specific stages of their illness, still die as often?

